    { "id": "grove-core", "page": "page-1", "x": 0, "y": -168, "w": 470, "text": "GROVE — the four core screens\nOat-green ground, sage accent, Figtree with an Instrument Serif display face. Rounded 26px cards, soft shadows, thick soft rings. Static mockups with sample data; copy and AA-contrast tuning still a pass away." },
    { "id": "grove-addpro", "page": "page-2", "x": 0, "y": -168, "w": 470, "text": "ADD FOOD & PRO\nThe logging flow (search → scan → custom food), the Pro paywall, and how the Dashboard reads for a free user — Water and Weight locked, everything else open. [PRICE] placeholders on the paywall are for you to fill." },
    { "id": "grove-dark", "page": "page-3", "x": 0, "y": -168, "w": 470, "text": "DARK MODE\nGrove's night palette: warm near-black ground (#14180f), raised cards (#1e2318), lightened sage and macro accents so the rings still read. Same layouts as the light core screens." },
